    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/b83bbc04aaf91314080848ef2a7a97a5.avif?t=1747863577\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/325bc676b417c069bd98c5d08eb02ae0.webp?t=1747863577\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">OnSlaught\u00a0puts you in the pilot seat of an unending nightmare - where an entire alien civilization wants you <strong>dead</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll face diverse enemies, each demanding a unique weapon and strategy to defeat, similar to classic boomer shooters like DOOM.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight flesh abominations, Slingshot around black holes, and destroy a hellish army of biomechanical alien ships while flying into the darkness of space.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/325bc676b417c069bd98c5d08eb02ae0.webp?t=1747863577\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/2e48a8a63a4c860e33a5d6eb0f49226f.poster.avif?t=1747863577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/2e48a8a63a4c860e33a5d6eb0f49226f.webm?t=1747863577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/982119a29fae486604c4bfde9b90965f.avif?t=1747863577\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/4d95446a1c95041ff7e86cf9132e6506.poster.avif?t=1747863577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/4d95446a1c95041ff7e86cf9132e6506.webm?t=1747863577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/325bc676b417c069bd98c5d08eb02ae0.webp?t=1747863577\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Almost every asteroid in OnSlaught is fully destructable. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use environmental debris you create to fling explosive barrels, asteroids, and space junk at you enemies alongside your massive arsenal of weapons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/325bc676b417c069bd98c5d08eb02ae0.webp?t=1747863577\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/6c824806281a41721276817dd143d129.avif?t=1747863577\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/c1c53fe89967595f2af2e3bfdb22c832.poster.avif?t=1747863577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/c1c53fe89967595f2af2e3bfdb22c832.webm?t=1747863577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/325bc676b417c069bd98c5d08eb02ae0.webp?t=1747863577\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your humanity has been stripped away. Only agony remains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">God will bleed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/325bc676b417c069bd98c5d08eb02ae0.webp?t=1747863577\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/b83bbc04aaf91314080848ef2a7a97a5.avif?t=1747863577\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/325bc676b417c069bd98c5d08eb02ae0.webp?t=1747863577\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">OnSlaught\u00a0puts you in the pilot seat of an unending nightmare - where an entire alien civilization wants you <strong>dead</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll face diverse enemies, each demanding a unique weapon and strategy to defeat, similar to classic boomer shooters like DOOM.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight flesh abominations, Slingshot around black holes, and destroy a hellish army of biomechanical alien ships while flying into the darkness of space.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/325bc676b417c069bd98c5d08eb02ae0.webp?t=1747863577\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/2e48a8a63a4c860e33a5d6eb0f49226f.poster.avif?t=1747863577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/2e48a8a63a4c860e33a5d6eb0f49226f.webm?t=1747863577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/982119a29fae486604c4bfde9b90965f.avif?t=1747863577\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><