ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/325bc676b417c069bd98c5d08eb02ae0.webp?t=1747863577\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your humanity has been stripped away. Only agony remains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">God will bleed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/325bc676b417c069bd98c5d08eb02ae0.webp?t=1747863577\" /></div></p>",
